  "body_html": "<p>Embrace the ancient beauty and deep symbolism of nature with the custom Tree of Life Quilt Set from Jeminise. This beautifully designed bedding set showcases intricate Celtic roots and branches, offering a cozy and comforting sanctuary for your bedroom. Expertly printed on soft, breathable fabric with lightweight warmth, it is perfect for year-round comfort, whether you are snuggling up indoors or taking it along for a rustic camping trip.</p>\n\n<h3>Key Features</h3>\n\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Personalized Design:</strong> Customize every aspect of this quilt, from the background and framing colors to the text saying squares with your own custom text or requests.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Comfort &amp; Warmth:</strong> Constructed with a soft, breathable polyester outer layer and filled with high-quality silk floss for lightweight, long-lasting comfort in all seasons.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Versatile Use:</strong> Multipurpose design makes it ideal as a bed quilt, cozy throw blanket, picnic mat, or backyard and camping gear.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Thoughtful Gift:</strong> An excellent present for nature lovers, moms, dads, and friends on Christmas, Valentine's Day, Mother's Day, or Father's Day.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy Care:</strong> Machine washable and fast-drying material designed to resist pilling, fading, and wrinkling for low-maintenance upkeep.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3>Product Specifications</h3>\n\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>Brand</th>\n<td>Jeminise</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Product Type</th>\n<td>Quilt Set</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Material</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fabric Type</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fill Material</th>\n<td>Silk Floss</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Style</th>\n<td>Farmhouse</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Theme</th>\n<td>Tree of Life, Flowers, Nature and Mythology</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Pattern</th>\n<td>Yggdrasil, Celtic Knots</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Included Components</th>\n<td>1 Quilt + Pillowcases (Optional)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Available Sizes</th>\n<td>Throw (60x70 inches), Twin (68x86 inches), Full (80x90 inches), Queen (90x90 inches), King (91x102 inches)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Care Instructions</th>\n<td>Machine Wash</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>",
